61:## 5. What does not count
62:
63:Stand-in leaf bundles (`crates/mori-recursion/src/standin.rs`); receipts from the lost host or only under `target/`; `checkStepInv` or `ProofPreimage::check` for a constraint or proof claim; a Kore, K or Quint result for circuit correspondence; `ToyLeaf` IVC tests for C6 semantics; public-input flips of an existing proof as malicious-witness soundness; a `ContractCall` at the address not bound to the manifest; a `status.json` pass whose fingerprints are stale; a systemd `Result=success` when the `heavy` line says exit 4; reviewer verdicts; aggregate pass counts as completion; stagenet (specVersion 2000000) evidence for a Preview or mainnet claim; a council vote.
