qa/gemini-quint/ivc06/REPORT.md:1:# Independent Circuit Audit: Sherlock Self-Recursive IVC Node `SHKIVC06`
qa/gemini-quint/ivc06/REPORT.md:2:
qa/gemini-quint/ivc06/REPORT.md:3:**Target:** `SHKIVC06` in [`crates/mori-recursion/src/ivc.rs`](../../../crates/mori-recursion/src/ivc.rs), [`crates/mori-recursion/tests/ivc_node_mock.rs`](../../../crates/mori-recursion/tests/ivc_node_mock.rs), [`crates/mori-recursion/tests/ivc_cost.rs`](../../../crates/mori-recursion/tests/ivc_cost.rs), Task 2.3 of [`openspec/changes/sherlock-vm-consensus-20261107/tasks.md`](../../../openspec/changes/sherlock-vm-consensus-20261107/tasks.md#L40), and [`clean/fork/Clean/Sherlock/Aggregation.lean`](../../../clean/fork/Clean/Sherlock/Aggregation.lean) (`AccAlgebra.nodeFold`, `genesis_collapse_both`, `non_genesis_keeps_both`, `src004_height_bridge`, `lin_refines_chain`).  
qa/gemini-quint/ivc06/REPORT.md:4:**Baseline Comparison:** [`qa/gemini-quint/ivc/ivc_circuit.qnt`](../ivc/ivc_circuit.qnt) and [`qa/gemini-quint/ivc/REPORT.md`](../ivc/REPORT.md) (`SHKIVC05` audit).  
