qa/gemini-quint/ivc06/REPORT.md:7:- [`qa/gemini-quint/ivc06/ivc06_test.qnt`](./ivc06_test.qnt) — 10-test verification suite covering completeness, Lean bridge lemmas, all 5 adversarial witness classes, `nodeFold` equivalence, and 5 seeded circuit mutants.
qa/gemini-quint/ivc06/REPORT.md:8:
qa/gemini-quint/ivc06/REPORT.md:9:---
qa/gemini-quint/ivc06/REPORT.md:10:
qa/gemini-quint/ivc06/REPORT.md:11:## 1. Overall Verdicts: SOUND and COMPLETE
qa/gemini-quint/ivc06/REPORT.md:12:
qa/gemini-quint/ivc06/REPORT.md:13:### 1.1 SOUND Verdict: **SOUND** (for `SherlockIvcRelation::circuit` paired with final accumulator verification)
qa/gemini-quint/ivc06/REPORT.md:14:
qa/gemini-quint/ivc06/REPORT.md:15:Every witness `(inst, w)` accepted by `SherlockIvcRelation::circuit` (`crates/mori-recursion/src/ivc.rs:456-565`) and the final accumulator pairing check (`SherlockIvcRelation::check_acc` at `ivc.rs:350-356` / `RunDeciderRelation::circuit` at `crates/mori-recursion/src/run_decider.rs:206, 276`) satisfies the reference semantics (`AccAlgebra.nodeFold`, `src004_height_bridge`, and `lin_refines_chain` in `clean/fork/Clean/Sherlock/Aggregation.lean:1201-1502`):
qa/gemini-quint/ivc06/REPORT.md:16:
qa/gemini-quint/ivc06/REPORT.md:17:1. **Height and Step Range Contract (`SRC-004`, `constrain_heights` at `ivc.rs:363-376, 497` $\leftrightarrow$ `src004_height_bridge` at `Aggregation.lean:1201-1206`):**
qa/gemini-quint/ivc06/REPORT.md:18:   - `std.assert_lower_than_fixed(l, prev_h, &h_bound)` (`ivc.rs:370`, with `h_bound = 1 << 64` from `H_BITS = 64` at `ivc.rs:79, 369`) constrains the canonical representative of `prev_h` in $\mathbb{F}_r$ to $[0, 2^{64})$. By `lower_than_fixed_correct` (`Aggregation.lean:1511-1525`), this rejects any negative/wrapped field element such as `prev_h = -2` (`r - 2`, `ivc_node_mock.rs:458`).
qa/gemini-quint/ivc06/REPORT.md:19:   - `let steps_m1 = std.add_constant(l, steps, -F::ONE)` (`ivc.rs:371`) followed by `std.assert_lower_than_fixed(l, &steps_m1, &BigUint::from(S_MAX))` (`ivc.rs:372`, with `S_MAX = 16` at `ivc.rs:77`) constrains $(\text{steps} - 1) \bmod r \in [0, 16)$, which holds in $\mathbb{F}_r$ iff $\text{steps} \in [1, 16]$. In particular, $\text{steps} = 0$ maps to $\text{steps\_m1} = r - 1 \ge 2^{64} > 16$ (refused), and $\text{steps} = 17$ maps to $\text{steps\_m1} = 16 \not< 16$ (refused). Because $S_{\max} = 16 < 2^{64}$, this single check discharges all three step hypotheses (`hsr : steps < 2^64`, `hs1 : 1 <= steps`, `hsS : steps <= S`) of `src004_height_bridge` (`Aggregation.lean:1201-1203`).
qa/gemini-quint/ivc06/REPORT.md:20:   - `let h = std.add(l, prev_h, steps)` (`ivc.rs:373`) followed by `std.assert_lower_than_fixed(l, &h, &h_bound)` (`ivc.rs:374`) constrains $h = (\text{prev\_h} + \text{steps}) \bmod r < 2^{64}$. Because $\text{prev\_h} < 2^{64}$, $\text{steps} < 2^{64}$, and $2^{65} \le r$ (BLS12-381 scalar field has 255 bits), `field_sum_exact` (`Aggregation.lean:1185-1187`) and `src004_height_bridge` (`Aggregation.lean:1201-1206`) guarantee that no modular wrap occurs: $h = \text{prev\_h} + \text{steps} \in [1, 2^{64})$, $\text{prev\_h} < h$, and $1 \le h - \text{prev\_h} \le S_{\max}$.
qa/gemini-quint/ivc06/REPORT.md:21:2. **Genesis Detection and Prefix-Chain Refinement (`ivc.rs:498-504, 522-538` $\leftrightarrow$ `lin_refines_chain` at `Aggregation.lean:1454-1485`):**
qa/gemini-quint/ivc06/REPORT.md:22:   - `let is_genesis = std.is_zero(l, &prev_h)` (`ivc.rs:498`) and `let not_genesis = std.not(l, &is_genesis)` (`ivc.rs:499`) constrain `is_genesis` $\in \{0,1\}$ with $\text{is\_genesis} = 1 \iff \text{prev\_h} = 0$.
qa/gemini-quint/ivc06/REPORT.md:23:   - Because every accepted node proof publishes $h = \text{prev\_h} + \text{steps} \ge 1$ (`LinCert.h_ne_zero`, `Aggregation.lean:1413-1419`), an accepted predecessor statement never has height $0$ (`lin_certified_prev_not_genesis`, `Aggregation.lean:1425-1427`), and because `constrain_heights` forbids modular wrap-around to $0$, `is_genesis == 1` holds only at true genesis (`prev_h = 0`).
qa/gemini-quint/ivc06/REPORT.md:24:   - `let chosen = std.select(l, &is_genesis, &init_d, &prev_d); std.assert_equal(l, &chosen, &prev_d)` (`ivc.rs:500-501`) enforces `prev_d == init_d` when `prev_h == 0`, matching `prev.h = 0 -> prev.cur = prev.init` in `linNode` (`Aggregation.lean:1381-1385`).
qa/gemini-quint/ivc06/REPORT.md:25:   - At non-genesis (`prev_h != 0`, `not_genesis = 1`), `prev_pi` (`ivc.rs:522-529`) binds `[self_vk_repr, prog_d, init_d, prev_d, prev_h, prev_acc_pi...]` into `verifier.prepare` (`ivc.rs:531-537`), and `leaf_inst` (`ivc.rs:549`) binds `[binding, prog_d, prev_d, cur_d, rule, prev_h, steps]` into `verify_child_incircuit_with` (`ivc.rs:550-559`). By `lin_refines_chain` (`Aggregation.lean:1454-1485`) and `lin_sound` (`Aggregation.lean:1488-1491`), every accepted linear node statement `(prog_d, init_d, cur_d, h)` refines the F21 segment `(prog_d, init_d, cur_d, 0, h)` certified by `chainOf` of its leaves.
qa/gemini-quint/ivc06/REPORT.md:26:3. **Genesis Neutrality and Collapsed-Carry Constraints (`SRC-005` Realization (a), `ivc.rs:383-421, 517-564` $\leftrightarrow$ `genesis_collapse_both` & `non_genesis_keeps_both` at `Aggregation.lean:1260-1310`):**
qa/gemini-quint/ivc06/REPORT.md:27:   - At genesis (`is_genesis = 1`, `not_genesis = 0`), `proof_acc` is scaled by `0` (`ivc.rs:538`) and collapsed (`ivc.rs:546`) to `trivial_acc`, while `constrain_genesis_neutral` (`ivc.rs:383-400, 520`) forces every public-input lane of `prev_acc` to equal `trivial_acc` (`is_genesis * (lane - neutral) == 0`). Thus both `proof_acc` and `prev_acc` equal `trivial_acc` entering `verifier.accumulate` (`ivc.rs:562`), closing the `CEX-3` genesis carry defect-cancellation / transcript-grinding vector from `SHKIVC05` and realizing `genesis_collapse_both` (`Aggregation.lean:1260-1278`).
qa/gemini-quint/ivc06/REPORT.md:28:   - Off genesis (`is_genesis = 0`, `not_genesis = 1`), `constrain_collapsed_carry` (`ivc.rs:409-421, 521`) forces both variable-base scalar lanes of `prev_acc` (`carry_scalar_lanes()` at `ivc.rs:239-248`) to `F::ONE`, ensuring `collapse(prev_acc) == prev_acc` and realizing `non_genesis_keeps_both` (`Aggregation.lean:1290-1310`).
qa/gemini-quint/ivc06/REPORT.md:29:
qa/gemini-quint/ivc06/REPORT.md:30:---
qa/gemini-quint/ivc06/REPORT.md:31:
qa/gemini-quint/ivc06/REPORT.md:32:### 1.2 COMPLETE Verdict: **COMPLETE**
qa/gemini-quint/ivc06/REPORT.md:33:
qa/gemini-quint/ivc06/REPORT.md:34:Every honest genesis step (`prev_h = 0`, `prev_d = init_d`, `prev_acc = trivial_acc()`, `1 <= steps <= S_MAX = 16`, valid leaf proof) and every honest non-genesis step (`1 <= prev_h < 2^64 - steps`, `1 <= steps <= S_MAX = 16`, valid predecessor node proof with its collapsed output accumulator `prev_acc`, valid leaf proof) is accepted by both `SherlockIvcRelation::next_acc` (`ivc.rs:277-300`) and `SherlockIvcRelation::circuit` (`ivc.rs:456-565`), and its folded accumulator passes `SherlockIvcRelation::check_acc` (`ivc.rs:350-356`):
qa/gemini-quint/ivc06/REPORT.md:35:
qa/gemini-quint/ivc06/REPORT.md:36:1. **Honest Heights Pass `constrain_heights` (`ivc.rs:363-376`):**
qa/gemini-quint/ivc06/REPORT.md:37:   For any integer $0 \le \text{prev\_h} < 2^{64}$ and $1 \le \text{steps} \le 16$ with $\text{prev\_h} + \text{steps} < 2^{64}$, `prev_h < 2^64` holds, $\text{steps} - 1 \in \{0, \dots, 15\} < 16$ holds, and $h = \text{prev\_h} + \text{steps} < 2^{64}$ holds. Verified by `ivc_node_genesis_mock` (`steps = 2`, `ivc_node_mock.rs:230-246`), `ivc_node_genesis_steps_bound` (`steps = S_MAX = 16`, `ivc_node_mock.rs:254-255`), and `ivc_node_step1_negatives` (`prev_h = 2, steps = 3 -> h = 5`, `ivc_node_mock.rs:406-418`).
qa/gemini-quint/ivc06/REPORT.md:38:2. **Honest Genesis Carry Passes `constrain_genesis_neutral` and `constrain_collapsed_carry` (`ivc.rs:200-210, 383-421`):**
qa/gemini-quint/ivc06/REPORT.md:39:   At genesis, the honest witness supplies `rel.trivial_acc()` (`ivc.rs:200-210`), which has public encoding `neutral` (so `x - t == 0` on every lane in `constrain_genesis_neutral`, `ivc.rs:397`) and variable-base scalars `F::ONE` on both `lhs` and `rhs` (so `constrain_collapsed_carry` holds, `ivc.rs:419`).
qa/gemini-quint/ivc06/REPORT.md:40:3. **Honest Non-Genesis Carry Passes `constrain_collapsed_carry` (`ivc.rs:345, 563`):**
qa/gemini-quint/ivc06/REPORT.md:41:   Every predecessor node step ends with `next.collapse(l, bls, scalar)` in-circuit (`ivc.rs:563`) and `acc.collapse()` off-circuit (`ivc.rs:345`), which produces an accumulator with 1 variable base and scalar `F::ONE` per side (`is_collapsed_carry == true`, `ivc.rs:252-261`). At non-genesis (`is_genesis = 0`), `constrain_genesis_neutral` multiplies `x - t` by `g = 0` (`ivc.rs:397`), which evaluates to `0` for any `prev_acc`.
qa/gemini-quint/ivc06/REPORT.md:42:4. **In-Circuit and Off-Circuit Fold Parity (`ivc.rs:316-346` vs `ivc.rs:531-564`):**
qa/gemini-quint/ivc06/REPORT.md:43:   At genesis (`prev[3] == F::ZERO`), `next_acc_raw` (`ivc.rs:317-318`) uses `self.trivial_acc()` for `proof_acc`, while `circuit` (`ivc.rs:538, 546`) scales `proof_acc` by `not_genesis = 0` and collapses it to the identical encoding `trivial_acc()`. At non-genesis, both prepare `prev_proof` and call `.collapse()` (`ivc.rs:333` and `ivc.rs:546`), leave `leaf_acc` uncollapsed (`ivc.rs:341-342` and `ivc.rs:557-558`), fold `[proof_acc, prev_acc, leaf_acc]`, and collapse the result (`ivc.rs:344-345` and `ivc.rs:562-563`).
