The code confirms two important limits. The current C6 producer publishes six lanes and pins outcome labels as circuit constants; completing the universal leaf requires more than adding `steps`. Also, Lean’s composition proof assumes leaf soundness, canonical genesis and accumulator soundness, so it does not prove those circuit obligations. [sherlock_c6_child.rs:538–608](crates/mori-backend/src/sherlock_c6_child.rs#L538), [AggregationAxioms.lean:15–45](clean/fork/Clean/Sherlock/AggregationAxioms.lean#L15)
